1
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:08,590
The dealer app opens on its own login screen, marked DEALER.

2
00:00:08,690 --> 00:00:13,730
Click the Server box and pick your dealing server from the list.

3
00:00:13,830 --> 00:00:18,180
Enter your dealer login.

4
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:22,700
Then your password. It stays hidden.

5
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,590
Click Login.

6
00:00:24,690 --> 00:00:33,650
The app loads every account, order and position in your book. On a large book this takes a few seconds.

7
00:00:33,750 --> 00:00:38,650
You are in. Connected at the top left means live updates are flowing.

